10 |     public function year(): int {
   |                     ^^^^ this name is already used
   = help: give the added member a different name. An added member never replaces or overrides another member

error[E1011]: `Acme\Shop\Order` already has a method named `label`
   --> %s:16:21
   |
16 |     public function label(): string {
   |                     ^^^^^ this name is already used
   |
   --> %sOrder.nvs:8:21
   |
 8 |     public function label(): string
   |                     ----- `Acme\Shop\Order::label` is declared here
   = help: give the added member a different name. An added member never replaces or overrides another member

error: aborting due to 2 errors
